# =============================================================================
# test count modifier — `repete` / `temporis` / `fragilis` take an integer
# =============================================================================
# The repetition modifiers are followed by a decimal count, never by the test
# block: `test "t" repete 3 { … }`. Omitting the count leaves the block where an
# integer belongs.
